WIN | 3 | 0 | north
WIN | 4 | 0 | north
WIN | 0 | 4 | south
WIN | 1 | 4 | south
WIN | 3 | 4 | south
WIN | 4 | 4 | south
WIN | 0 | 1 | west
WIN | 0 | 2 | west
WIN | 0 | 3 | west
WIN | 4 | 1 | east
WIN | 4 | 2 | east
WIN | 4 | 3 | east
